              "line": 3,
              "heading": "ZX Bank Surat Branch Network"
            },
            "text": "ZX Bank Ltd. is committed to delivering accessible and reliable banking services across Surat, one of Gujarat’s fastest-growing urban centers. With a robust network spanning the city’s North, South, East, West, and Central regions, ZX Bank ensures that individuals and businesses can conveniently access modern financial solutions close to home. Each branch offers a full suite of retail, corporate, and digital services—supported by experienced staff and state-of-the-art banking infrastructure."
